{"about_the_game":"\ud83c\udfdb Empire of Lust \u2014 Demo<br>Welcome to the Empire of Lust demo \u2014 your first step into a decadent Roman visual novel where pleasure and politics collide.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724150/extras/gif_4.gif?t=1749927427\" /><br>This demo offers a curated introduction to the full experience, letting you explore the game's setting, meet key characters, and make choices that shape your rise as a young patrician in Ancient Rome.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724150/extras/gif_2.gif?t=1749927427\" /><br>\ud83c\udfae What\u2019s Included in This Demo:<br>\ud83d\udd0a Fully voiced introductory scenes \u2014 Experience the opening chapter with professional voice acting and animated character portraits.<br>\ud83c\udfdb Story-driven gameplay \u2014 Begin your journey after your father's death and take your first steps in reclaiming your family's position in Roman society.<br>\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83e\uddb0 Meet the first three women \u2014 Form initial connections with Cassia, Livia, and Selena. Each offers a different dynamic, hinting at the relationships and harem-building mechanics of the full game.<br>\ud83d\udcac Choice-based interactions \u2014 Decide how you respond to challenges, flirtations, and social opportunities. Your decisions begin shaping your reputation and relationships.<br>\ud83c\udf89 A taste of the party-planning mechanic \u2014 Organize your first small gathering, setting the stage for the grand Roman festivities to come.<br>\ud83d\udd1e Mature content preview \u2014 Contains a limited selection of adult scenes, illustrating the tone and themes of the full game.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724150/extras/gif_1.gif?t=1749927427\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app